WEBVTT

00:00:03.335 --> 00:00:06.670
Cooling budget? The waterfall does it for free.

00:00:12.506 --> 00:00:15.008
Just park half of it with us. We'll manage it. And bill it.

00:00:22.511 --> 00:00:25.012
This half stays here. We decide where the line sits.

00:00:27.514 --> 00:00:30.015
Look, the numbers ran. Those usually survive anything.

